---
description: SQL migrations and Supabase schema safety
globs: "sql/**/*.sql"
alwaysApply: false
---

# SQL / schema

- New changes = new numbered file in `sql/` (do not silently rewrite applied history).
- Prefer additive migrations; document RLS intent in comments.
- Public INSERT policies are sensitive — prefer API/service-role paths for abuse surfaces.
- After schema work: note apply status in PR/summary; use Supabase advisors when available.
